third_party/iree_compat/
========================

The C-API header files under this directory are vendored unmodified from
the IREE project (https://github.com/iree-org/iree), tag `iree-3.11.0`.

Specifically, the files under:
  - iree/base/
  - iree/hal/
  - iree/vm/
  - iree/runtime/
  - iree/io/

are copies of the corresponding files in `runtime/src/iree/{base,hal,vm,runtime,io}/`
in the upstream IREE source tree at that tag.

